roles-antag-category-colony = Colony Antags
roles-antag-category-prometheus = Prometheus Antags

cmu-antag-arsonist-name = Arsonist
cmu-antag-arsonist-objective = Watch it all burn.
cmu-antag-arsonist-greeting = The colony took everything from you. Now you will take everything from the colony. You have a flamethrower and a grudge. Light it up, but don't get caught with the torch.

cmu-antag-bounty-hunter-name = Bounty Hunter
cmu-antag-bounty-hunter-objective = Track down the colony's wanted and collect the bounties.
cmu-antag-bounty-hunter-greeting = You hunt people for a living, and this colony is crawling with bounties. You will be briefed with the current wanted list shortly. Bring them in alive when you can, dead when you must, and don't ask too many questions.

roles-antag-cannibal-name = Cannibal
roles-antag-cannibal-objective = Feed your hunger, don't get caught
cannibal-role-greeting = You have an unnatural hunger that can only be sated by human flesh. Your butcher's knife opens every opportunity. Don't get caught; the Marshals escalate for every meal.

roles-antag-clf-guerrilla-name = CLF Guerrilla
roles-antag-clf-guerrilla-objective = Listen to your cell leader. Fight to free your home from the influence of governments and corporations.
roles-antag-clf-guerrilla-greeting = You are a member of a sleeper cell. Wait until your leader contacts you and organizes the cell before you act.

roles-antag-clf-leader-name = CLF Leader
roles-antag-clf-leader-objective = Lead your cell to victory. Free your home from the influence of outside governments and corporations through whatever means necessary.
roles-antag-clf-leader-greeting = You're the commander for this cell of the Colonial Liberation Front. Free your home through whatever means necessary.

roles-antag-clf-physician-name = CLF Physician
roles-antag-clf-doctor-objective = Listen to your cell leader. Ensure the health and well being of your cell, the colony, and any prisoners you have captured.
roles-antag-clf-doctor-greeting = You are a member of a sleeper cell. Wait until your leader contacts you and organizes the cell before you act.
roles-antag-clf-surgeon-name = CLF Surgeon

cmu-antag-clf-saboteur-name = CLF Saboteur
cmu-antag-clf-saboteur-objective = Cripple the colony's infrastructure before the liberation begins.
cmu-antag-clf-saboteur-greeting = The Colonial Liberation Front saved you, and now it is time to repay the debt. Destroy the colony's power and communications infrastructure with your charges. Every APC and comms console that dies brings the liberation closer.

roles-antag-clf-sleeper-agent-name = CLF Sleeper Agent
roles-antag-clf-sleeper-agent-objective = Aid the CLF insurgents from within. Undermine Government Forces operations without exposing your cover.
clf-sleeper-agent-role-greeting = You are a CLF sleeper agent embedded within Government Forces. You have worked your way into a position of trust. Help the insurgents however you can — leak intel, sabotage operations, misdirect your unit. Do not reveal yourself unless you have no other choice.

roles-antag-clfveteran-name = CLF Veteran
roles-antag-clfveteran-objective = Reignite the cause if you see fit or live your new life in peace.
clfveteran-role-greeting = You left that life behind but sometimes the call of freedom rings back to you. Law enforcement know you're in the colony but don't know your name.

roles-antag-cultist-name = Xeno Cultist
roles-antag-cultist-objective = Listen to the commands of the Xenomorph Queen. Ensure the survival of the hive at all costs.
roles-antag-cultist-greeting = You feel an alien presence enter your mind. "Obey these words. Assist my children in prosperity and you will earn a place amongst the angels." is what you hear as your mind fractures. As your mind reforms you have but one goal: The hive must grow.

roles-antag-dealer-name = Drug Dealer
roles-antag-dealer-objective = Sell your product.
dealer-role-greeting = You're a drug dealer, sell your product.

roles-antag-exped-traitor-name = Expedition Traitor
roles-antag-exped-traitor-objective = Fuel your sick desire
exped-traitor-role-greeting = You're a traitor to the expedition, for reasons of insanity, malfunction, or greed. It matters not. Eliminate them.

roles-antag-fugitive-name = Wanted Fugitive
roles-antag-fugitive-objective = Avoid Capture
fugitive-role-greeting = You've found some damning secrets on the company, avoid capture and expose them.

monster-traitor-name = Thing From Another World
monster-traitor-objective = Eliminate those infringing on your territory
monster-antag-role-greeting = This planet is your home, and these scientists have got to go.

roles-antag-runaway-synth-name = Runaway Synth
roles-antag-synth-objective = Do whatever you must to survive.
runawaysynth-role-greeting = You're a runaway synthetic, law enforcement is looking to deactivate you - permanently. Do whatever you must to survive.

roles-antag-serialkiller-name = Serial Killer
roles-antag-serialkiller-objective = Kill and avoid capture
serialkiller-role-greeting = You have an insatiable urge to kill. Find your victims and don't leave witnesses. Law enforcement has your fingerprints from previous crime scenes.

roles-antag-spy-name = Corporate Spy
roles-antag-spy-objective = Steal WY research assets and exfiltrate them with your data link.
spy-role-greeting = You're a corporate spy for Laselle Bionational. Steal Weyland-Yutani research assets and carry them out with your data link before the company finds you. You've been given an ID card to help you get in.

roles-antag-strikeorganizer-name = Strike Organizer
roles-antag-strikeorganizer-objective = Get the strike petition signed and organize the workers.
strikeorganizer-role-greeting = You're a labor organizer. Get your petition signed, rally the workers, demand better conditions and pay, and don't let the corporations push you around.

cmu-antag-vigilante-name = Vigilante
cmu-antag-vigilante-objective = Clean up the colony's criminal element. The law won't do it.
cmu-antag-vigilante-greeting = The Marshals are useless and corrupt, the mob runs this colony. Not on your watch. You will be sent the names of the mob's members shortly. They are not people, they are problems - and you solve problems. Just don't get caught holding the bat.

cmu-antag-wy-agent-name = Weyland-Yutani Agent
cmu-antag-wy-agent-objective = Recover company assets and silence witnesses. Do not expose the company.
cmu-antag-wy-agent-greeting = You are a Weyland-Yutani field operative. Company assets have gone missing in this colony. Recover what belongs to us, eliminate anyone who knows too much, and never reveal the company's hand. Use your data link once you have the assets on you.

cmu-bounty-hunter-empty = No active bounties on the colony's books. Someone always owes someone, though. Keep your ears open.
cmu-bounty-hunter-list = Current bounties on the colony's books:
cmu-cannibal-meal = The hunger recedes... for now. That makes {$count}.
cmu-corporate-beacon-insufficient = The data link scans your belongings: {$count}/{$required} high-value items. Not enough to transmit.
cmu-corporate-beacon-transmit = The data link hums as it transmits to {$corporation}. Payment incoming.
cmu-petition-already-signed = You have already signed this petition.
cmu-petition-empty = No one has signed yet.
cmu-petition-examine = A strike petition: {$count}/{$goal} signatures. Signed by: {$names}
cmu-petition-signed = You sign the petition ({$count}/{$goal}).
cmu-summary-detail-agent-complete = They exfiltrated stolen {$corporation} assets.
cmu-summary-detail-agent-failed = They failed their {$corporation} contract.
cmu-summary-detail-arsonist = They set {$count} structure fires.
cmu-summary-detail-bounty-captured = They were hauled in alive and the bounty was paid.
cmu-summary-detail-bounty-dead = They died with the bounty unclaimed.
cmu-summary-detail-bounty-free = They were never brought in.
cmu-summary-detail-bounty-killed = They were killed and the bounty was paid out.
cmu-summary-detail-cannibal = They ate {$count} colonists.
cmu-summary-detail-fate-dead = They did not survive the round.
cmu-summary-detail-hunter = They were briefed on {$count} wanted colonists.
cmu-summary-detail-none = Their work stays in the shadows.
cmu-summary-detail-saboteur = They destroyed {$count} pieces of colony infrastructure.
cmu-summary-detail-strike = Their petition gathered {$count}/{$goal} signatures.
cmu-summary-detail-vigilante = {$count} mob members were on their list.
cmu-summary-entry = {$name} ({$user}) was the {$role}. {$detail}
cmu-summary-petition = A strike petition gathered {$count}/{$goal} signatures.
cmu-vigilante-empty = The mob has no presence in this colony. Keep your eyes open; scum always crawls out eventually.
cmu-vigilante-list = The mob's members in this colony:
